            "category": "description",
            "text": "The cross site scripting flaw has been discovered in the npm react-router package. A XSS vulnerability exists in in React Router's meta()/<Meta> APIs in Framework Mode when generating script:ld+json tags which could allow arbitrary JavaScript execution during SSR if untrusted content is used to generate the tag.",
